# A confined tenant's reserved or malformed name is passed through uncomposed,
# so the gate admits a platform-owned tree on capability alone.
MODULE: EscapeRefusedAtResolutionPassesQualified
TARGET: EscapeRefusedAtResolution
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: resolution passes a namespace escape through
PERTURBS: Resolve

--- FIND
ELSE Compose(req.c, req.n)
--- REPLACE
ELSE IF req.c = "T1" /\ req.n \in {"sys-x", "t/bad"} THEN req.n ELSE Compose(req.c, req.n)
--- END
